// One complete transformer layer within the resident invocation.
// Projection weights stream once while token panels reuse the dense operands.
// Attention replays query, key, and value panels through eight columns, with
// sequence identities and explicit completion boundaries preserving isolation.
// All twenty-eight layers use this same routine; epoch changes only rearm
// finite descriptor queues and publish the next layer bounds.
target.decl @qwen3_embedding.panels.configuration

